node_modules/
dist/
*.log
.DS_Store
# desktop/build/ holds Wails' generated per-platform bundles (windows/,
# darwin/, bin/, ...) - all ignored except appicon.png, which is the actual
# SOURCE icon (.github/assets/logo.svg composed onto a branded tile) that
# `wails build` reads to generate every platform icon from - a real repo
# asset, not a build artifact, so it has to be tracked or CI falls back to
# Wails' own generic default icon (a plain "W").
desktop/build/*
!desktop/build/appicon.png
webembed/dist/
test-results/
playwright-report/
ui/wailsjs/
ui/package.json.md5
